{"file": "天灾末世，她囤满物资后所向披靡！-第46集.mp4", "ep": 46, "duration": 50.7, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.96, "text": "我们没吃"}, {"start": 1.2, "end": 2.36, "text": "就坐边上闻了闻"}, {"start": 2.36, "end": 3.32, "text": "闻也不行"}, {"start": 3.48, "end": 4.52, "text": "这锅油气"}, {"start": 4.76, "end": 6.04, "text": "也是我花钱买的"}, {"start": 6.94, "end": 7.66, "text": "闻了"}, {"start": 7.94, "end": 8.86, "text": "就算偷"}, {"start": 9.18, "end": 9.66, "text": "这"}, {"start": 10.34, "end": 11.66, "text": "闻个味也叫偷"}, {"start": 12.3, "end": 12.86, "text": "叫"}, {"start": 13.18, "end": 13.78, "text": "陪吧"}, {"start": 14.34, "end": 14.86, "text": "老大"}, {"start": 15.62, "end": 16.46, "text": "是我起的头"}, {"start": 16.62, "end": 17.3, "text": "罚我一个"}, {"start": 17.42, "end": 17.94, "text": "坐下"}, {"start": 18.46, "end": 20.26, "text": "你们不是当兵的比我奖励吗"}, {"start": 20.54, "end": 20.98, "text": "说"}, {"start": 21.42, "end": 22.18, "text": "这事咋办"}, {"start": 22.42, "end": 22.94, "text": "大姐"}, {"start": 23.54, "end": 24.78, "text": "我们陪你一锅菜"}, {"start": 24.78, "end": 25.3, "text": "成步"}, {"start": 26.22, "end": 27.02, "text": "拿啥陪"}, {"start": 27.26, "end": 28.78, "text": "这年头上哪找一样的菜"}, {"start": 28.9, "end": 29.78, "text": "我现在就要"}, {"start": 29.78, "end": 30.82, "text": "你这不奖励"}, {"start": 31.42, "end": 32.78, "text": "偷了我东西还瞪我"}, {"start": 32.98, "end": 34.3, "text": "到城你们受欺负了"}, {"start": 35.68, "end": 36.08, "text": "成"}, {"start": 36.68, "end": 37.4, "text": "你说咋陪"}, {"start": 37.6, "end": 38.16, "text": "我们照做"}, {"start": 38.16, "end": 38.84, "text": "简单"}, {"start": 39.16, "end": 40.08, "text": "拿人陪"}, {"start": 40.64, "end": 41.48, "text": "我大放点"}, {"start": 41.68, "end": 42.8, "text": "收你们当手下"}, {"start": 43.68, "end": 44.44, "text": "想得美"}, {"start": 44.76, "end": 45.64, "text": "我们得回部队"}, {"start": 46.72, "end": 47.92, "text": "那就把东西陪来"}, {"start": 48.36, "end": 49.08, "text": "不陪"}, {"start": 49.28, "end": 50.36, "text": "都处这儿等着"}]}